{"sections":[{"slug":"游走的伴随","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"游走的伴随"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">游走的伴随</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"游走的伴随"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">游走的伴随</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是一个具有两个对象的</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Adj}$, <span lang=\"zh\">任何</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ (<span lang=\"zh\">例如</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}$) <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">等同于函子</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Adj} \\to \\mathcal C.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">因此这是一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/游走","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">游走</span>"}},{"Plain":" (“<span lang=\"zh\">自由</span>”) <span lang=\"zh\">的结构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">具体地</span>, $\\mathsf{Adj}$ <span lang=\"zh\">有如下对象与态射</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">两个对象</span> $c,d$;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">两个态射</span> $l\\colon c\\to d$, $r\\colon d\\to c$;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">两个</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $\\eta\\colon \\mathrm{id}_c \\to rl$; $\\epsilon\\colon lr\\to\\mathrm{id}_d$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的条件</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">注意</span> $\\mathsf{Adj}$ <span lang=\"zh\">仅为</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">故这些条件是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">性质而非结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">即</span>$$\r\nl \\overset{\\eta}{\\to} lrl \\overset{\\epsilon}{\\to} l = \\mathrm{id}_l,\\,\r\nr \\overset{\\eta}{\\to} rlr \\overset{\\epsilon}{\\to} r = \\mathrm{id}_r;\r\n$$</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">以及上述资料按照条件</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">自由生成</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的所有态射与</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">态射</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">上述资料生成的结果为</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\operatorname{Hom}(c,c) = \\{\\mathrm{id}_c,rl,rlrl,\\cdots\\} = \\Delta_+$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯形范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">增广单纯形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\operatorname{Hom}(c,d) = \\{l,lrl,lrlrl,\\cdots\\}$;</li>\n<li>$\\operatorname{Hom}(d,c) = \\{r,rlr,rlrlr,\\cdots\\}$;</li>\n<li>$\\operatorname{Hom}(d,d) = \\{\\mathrm{id}_d,lr,lrlr,\\cdots\\} = \\Delta_+^{\\mathrm{op}}$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">注意到上述资料中</span> $\\operatorname{Hom}(c,c) = \\{\\mathrm{id}_c,rl,rlrl,\\cdots\\} = \\Delta_+$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯形范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">增广单纯形范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $rl$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/游走","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">游走</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">故任意伴随中</span> $rl$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随给出单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随给出单子</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}